<h1 class="text-left text-2xl text-gray-200 m-2">Pricing</h1>
<h2 class="text-left text-xl text-gray-200 m-2 font-bold">Trial</h2>
<div class="text-gray-200 text-left w-[400px] m-2">
  <p>Try the app for as long as you want. The trial is limited to 250 actions, after which you will have to pay for a Subscription.</p>
</div>
<h2 class="text-left text-xl text-gray-200 m-2 font-bold">Subscription</h2>
<div class="text-gray-200 text-left w-[400px] m-2">
  <p>The paid subscription costs $30 USD for six months (averaging $5 per month).</p>
</div>
